    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Yes, there is a [`config.window.config`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/eb0f557a5797cfe9c720ed84a71582c22bccb4f8/doc/mini-clue.txt#L557) for that. Setting it to `{ title = { { '', 'MiniClueBorder' } } }` removes the title.\r\n\r\nBut I'd like to mention that title shows useful information about the currently typed keys and there is no (and won't be) any testing that title can be disabled. So the above solution might stop working at any time.",
